SUMMARY:Family Fun Fest
DESCRIPTION:As the sun drops over Nugget Fields\, hundreds of Davis families spread across the grass for one of the Chamber’s most-loved traditions. Live music\, hands-on games\, face painting\, roaming photos\, food trucks\, and dozens of local businesses and nonprofits\, all in one joyful\, free evening.
