SUMMARY:Intermediate Watercolor with Misuk Goltz
DESCRIPTION:Intermediate Watercolor with Misuk Goltz in Davis \nTuesdays\, 10 AM – 12 PM | September 1\, 8\, 15\, 22\, 29 \n$170 Members\, $190 Non-Members (Materials not included) \n  \nThis 5-week workshop with Misuk Goltz will focus on using your brushes to their full potential and practicing diverse hand motions to achieve painterly\, expressive watercolor paintings. Students will learn how to distribute different values to create balanced and sophisticated artwork while painting various subjects. Please note that this class is intended for participants who have previous experience with watercolor techniques and color blending. The use of high-quality watercolor materials is strongly recommended to achieve the best results. \n  \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/ \n  \nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/intermediate-watercolor-with-misuk-goltz/2026-09-08/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Misuk-1-copy.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
