UID:10003029-1789221600-1789228800@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Davis Musical Theatre Presents Aladdin Jr
DESCRIPTION:Davis Musical Theatre Presents Aladdin Jr. \nBased on the iconic animated film\, with an Academy Award-winning score by Alan Menken\, Howard Ashman and Tim Rice\, Disney’s Aladdin Jr. is sure to send audiences soaring on a flying carpet ride filled with romance and adventure. \nWhen the street urchin\, Aladdin\, vies for the attention of the beautiful princess\, Jasmine\, he uses a genie’s magic power to become a prince in order to marry her. Iago\, Jafar\, the Genie and more are here in Disney’s Aladdin JR.\, a musical adventure filled with magic\, mayhem and the power of love.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/davis-musical-theatre-presents-aladdin-jr/
LOCATION:Davis Musical Theatre Company (DMTC)\, The Jean Henderson Performing Arts Center\, 607 Pena Drive\, Davis
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Aladdin-og3arm.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Musical Theatre Company (DMTC)":MAILTO:info@dmtc.org
END:VEVENT
