SUMMARY:Taste of Davis and Yolo
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a variety of outstanding foods\, wines\, desserts\, beer\, and more from multiple purveyors from throughout Yolo County! \nPlease join the Davis Odd Fellows as we host the popular “A Taste of Davis and Yolo.” This year’s event will feature an excellent collection of local purveyors of fine food\, wine\, beer\, and desserts all under one roof at one low price! The cost is just $20 in advance. Tickets are limited and this event will sell out\, so be sure to get yours ASAP! Note that you must be at least 21 years old to consume any alcoholic beverages. \nYour ticket allows you to sample eclectic and tasty food and beverages from purveyors on both floors of our beautiful hall. Our full list of purveyors is still being finalized\, but so far includes: Buckhorn Meat Co.\, Curry Kabab Paradise\, Davis Creamery\, Dunloe Brewing\, Great Bear Vineyards\, Hunan Bar & Restaurant\, L&L Hawaiian BBQ\, Mercado Davis\, Tommy J’s Grill & Catering\, and Turkovich Family Wines \nIn addition to showcasing local fare\, “A Taste of Davis and Yolo” is a fund-raising event to support the Davis Odd Fellows Lodge\, Meals on Wheels Yolo County  and STEAC. \nTickets on sale Now! \nhttps://davisoddfellowstoday2026.eventbrite.com/ \nWe thank Edward Jones and its employees as our Major Sponsor for the event\, as well as our many other individual and corporate sponsors for making this event possible!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/taste-of-davis-and-yolo/
LOCATION:Davis Odd Fellows Hall\, 415 2nd Street\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/2026-T-O-D-A-Y-FLYER-DRAFT-5-small-CxOJb6.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Odd Fellows":MAILTO:smartzgraphics@yahoo.com
END:VEVENT
