CREATED:20260808T173047Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T190043Z
UID:10003021-1790532000-1790539200@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:September Open Mic and Music Trivia
DESCRIPTION:Welcome in the Fall with Watermelon Music’s September Open Mic & Music Trivia in Davis! \nWhether you’re looking for a venue to share your own talents or just looking to enjoy hearing (and seeing) some local performers\, we invite you to this free monthly event. We provide the sound\, stage and lights – the rest is up to you. Play us your favorite song\, tell us some jokes\, act out a scene from your favorite play with friends. \nWe will continue to feature our Music Trivia contest throughout the evening in between acts. The winner will receive a $20 Watermelon Music gift card! \nWe ask that each performance be suitable for an all-ages venue\, and that you arrive on time and stay until the end to support your fellow performers. \nFREE!!!\nDoors open/sign-ups @ 5:30.\nFirst act @ 6:00. \nPlease help support the Watermelon Music with your purchase of a drink or a snack at Open Mic!  Non-alcoholic drinks and pre-packaged snacks are available for sale at The Melon Ball.  (Cash or Venmo only) \nWe hope to see you there!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/september-open-mic-and-music-trivia/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/watermelon-Music-Open-Mic-740-x-546-px-E7CTl2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
