SUMMARY:Davis Neighbors' Night Out
DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Davis\, Yolo County\, ASUCD\, and UC Davis in celebrating community during Davis Neighbors’ Night Out. Davis Neighbors’ Night Out is a celebration of our community and a great opportunity for neighbors to get to know one another. Connected neighborhoods create safer and more caring places to live \n  \nEvents include potlucks\, neighborhood games and activities and gatherings of neighbors to meet in the street for good conversation. \n  \nDavis Neighbors’ Night Out is open to all ages and is free to participate in. \n  \nNeighbors\, neighborhood associations\, apartment complexes\, etc.\, are encouraged to be an “Event Sponsor.” If you’re interested in becoming an event sponsor\, visit: https://www.cityofdavis.org/city-hall/city-manager-s-office/community-events/davis-neighbors-night-out
